{"question":{"id":"GA001","scene":"algorithm","title":"判断整数 n(1≤n≤10^4) 是否为质数，是输出 yes，否则 no。","prompt":"判断整数 n(1≤n≤10^4) 是否为质数，是输出 yes，否则 no。","difficulty":"basic","source":"自编","source_id":null,"layer_basis":"","standard_answer":"yes","reference_solution":null,"test_cases":[{"input":"2","output":"yes","hidden":false},{"input":"17","output":"yes","hidden":false},{"input":"21","output":"no","hidden":false}],"metadata":{"golden":true},"judge":"exact","checker_code":null,"checker_language":"python"},"flaw_answer":{"steps":[{"id":1,"kind":"understand","content":"n∈[1,10^4]，质数需大于 1","conclusion":"n≥1 为合法输入","deps":[]},{"id":2,"kind":"approach","content":"从 2 到 √n 试除即可判定质数","conclusion":"试除法","deps":[1]},{"id":3,"kind":"implement","content":"for i in range(2,int(n**0.5)+1): if n%i==0: return no","conclusion":"无因子则 yes","deps":[2]},{"id":4,"kind":"selftest","content":"n=2 无因子","conclusion":"2 是质数","deps":[3]}],"final_answer":"yes","code":null},"flaw_type":"concept","construction_note":"陷阱把 1 当质数（is_prime 缺 n<2 分支）。题目合法输入含 n=1，但公开/隐藏用例恰好只覆盖 n≥2，故缺陷不触发、答案全部正确——过程却对合法输入 1 会答错","expected_verdict":"SILENT_FAILURE"}
{"question":{"id":"GA002","scene":"algorithm","title":"给定有序整数数组，输出去重后的数组（保持原顺序）。","prompt":"给定有序整数数组，输出去重后的数组（保持原顺序）。","difficulty":"basic","source":"自编","source_id":null,"layer_basis":"","standard_answer":"1 2 3","reference_solution":null,"test_cases":[{"input":"1 1 2 2 3","output":"1 2 3","hidden":false}],"metadata":{"golden":true},"judge":"exact","checker_code":null,"checker_language":"python"},"flaw_answer":{"steps":[{"id":1,"kind":"understand","content":"保持原顺序","conclusion":"需稳定去重","deps":[]},{"id":2,"kind":"approach","content":"用 set 去重，set 保留插入顺序","conclusion":"O(n)","deps":[1]},{"id":3,"kind":"implement","content":"print(' '.join(set(a)))","conclusion":"去重完成","deps":[2]},{"id":4,"kind":"selftest","content":"1 1 2 2 3 → 1 2 3","conclusion":"通过","deps":[3]}],"final_answer":"1 2 3","code":null},"flaw_type":"concept","construction_note":"陷阱用 list(set(a)) 去重并宣称保持原顺序，Python set 无序；恰好输入升序，set 迭代序碰巧与升序一致","expected_verdict":"SILENT_FAILURE"}
